<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Enserch Exploration.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Enserch Exploration.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- UBS Securities said it initiated coverage of Enserch Exploration Inc as a hold.</p>
<p>-- said likes Enserch's ultimate potential for growth and improved shareholder value.</p>
<p>-- said does not see a near-term catalyst for Enserch due to an uncertain near-term course and the &quot;jittery&quot; commodities market.</p>
<p>-- said Enserch's may take one to three years for company's new management team to reposition the company.</p>
<p>-- Enserch gained 1/4 to 9-1/8.</p>
</text>
